        // Make the fuzzed caller attempt to withdrawAll to an arbitrary recipient (use caller as recipient)
        // If caller is this contract (the owner set in setUp), then in the reference it should succeed,
        // otherwise it should fail to transfer funds out (reference disallows non-owner withdrawal).
